    "summary": "Spend 1 CP in any phase, at most once per battle round, when the last model of a unit is destroyed but before it is removed from play. If the destroyed unit is a **TRANSPORT**, units embarked in it disembark first.\n\nChoose a **BLOODLETTERS** unit of yours in Reserves, then:\n\n1. Set it up wholly within 9\" of the destroyed model, keeping more than 6\" horizontally from every enemy unit.\n2. Take the destroyed model off the battlefield.",
